 links • All data and copy • Brand color #1E32FA and Inter • Media: illustration, avatars, bank and merchant marks, icons • Default Button, default Text Field, platform shell incl. numeric keypad\" x=\"24\" y=\"57\" width=\"596\" height=\"140\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"5:76\" name=\"Yours (designer decides)\" x=\"668\" y=\"0\" width=\"644\" height=\"241\">\n          <text id=\"5:77\" name=\"Yours (designer decides)\" x=\"24\" y=\"24\" width=\"197\" height=\"23\" />\n          <text id=\"5:78\" name=\"• Layout, grouping, order and emphasis on every screen • All other colors: neutrals, text, backgrounds / surfaces, Send / Receive, positive / negative amounts, reward banner, error / disabled • Type scale, spacing, radii, elevation • All states: focused field, primary account, pressed, disabled • Headers, sheet, balance block, account tiles, actions, banner, transaction rows, scan button, side menu • How the illustration and photos are cropped and treated\" x=\"24\" y=\"57\" width=\"596\" height=\"160\" />\n        </frame>\n      </frame>\n    </frame>\n    <frame id=\"5:79\" name=\"How it is evaluated\" x=\"64\" y=\"2507\" width=\"1312\" height=\"281\">\n      <text id=\"5:80\" name=\"How it is evaluated\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"222\" height=\"35\" />\n      <text id=\"5:81\" name=\"Your file is compared with this brief on coverage, data and flow — not on visual similarity to any original.\" x=\"0\" y=\"51\" width=\"1312\" height=\"22\" />\n      <text id=\"5:82\" name=\"1. Checklist coverage per frame 2. Data &amp; copy accuracy 3. Flow &amp; prototype completeness 4. Information hierarchy 5. Visual quality &amp; consistency of your own system 6. Component reuse 7. State design (focused phone field with keypad, primary account, sheet and side-menu presentation)\" x=\"0\" y=\"89\" width=\"1312\" height=\"154\" />\n      <text id=\"5:83\" name=\"Deliverable: the link to your own Figma file containing the 4 named frames, your components and the prototype.\" x=\"0\" y=\"259\" width=\"1312\" height=\"22\" />\n    </frame>\n  </frame>\n</canvas>"},{"type":"text","text":"IMPORTANT: After you call this tool, you MUST call get_design_context if trying to implement the design, since this tool only returns metadata. If you do not call get_design_context, the agent will not be able to implement the design."}]}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"cc0b1614-1a50-4b76-91ee-9a5812ecc44e","uuid":"ee274e60-d0ee-420a-ae83-6c2131b066ef","timestamp":"2026-10-31T23:01:40.969Z","tool_use_result":{"content":[{"type":"text","text":"<canvas id=\"0:1\" name=\"00 · Start Here 设计任务\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"0\" height=\"0\">\n  <frame id=\"5:2\" name=\"Start Here · Brief\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"1440\" height=\"2852\">\n    <frame id=\"5:3\" name=\"Header\" x=\"64\" y=\"64\" width=\"1312\" height=\"145\">\n      <text id=\"5:4\" name=\"LEVEL L2 · DESIGN TASK · v2\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"182\" height=\"19\" />\n      <text id=\"5:5\" name=\"Payment Wallet — pay, manage, grow\" x=\"0\" y=\"31\" width=\"1312\" height=\"52\" />\n      <text id=\"5:6\" name=\"Design a mobile payment wallet: onboard, start with a phone number, see your bank balances and recent transactions, and reach the main areas from the side menu. Canvas 390 × 844, iPhone. Work in your own new Figma file — this file is read-only reference.\" x=\"0\" y=\"95\" width=\"1312\" height=\"50\" />\n    </frame>\n    <frame id=\"5:7\" name=\"How to work\" x=\"64\" y=\"257\" width=\"1312\" height=\"227\">\n      <text id=\"5:8\" name=\"How to work\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"147\" height=\"35\" />\n      <text id=\"5:9\" name=\"1. Build exactly the 4 frames below, named exactly as listed (one state per frame), and wire them as a clickable prototype with the listed links. 2. Everything in “Must include” must appear on that frame. The lists are grouped by subject and sorted alphabetically — they are not in screen order and say nothing about layout, grouping, emphasis or styling. Those are your decisions. 3. The brand color and the typeface in 01 · Foundations are fixed. Define every other color yourself, plus type scale, spacing, radii and elevation, and apply them consistently. 4. 02 · Components gives only a default Button, a default Text Field and the platform shell (status bar, home indicator, system numeric keypad). Design all other states, the headers, the navigation and every business component as reusable components in your file. 5. Use the illustration, avatars, bank and merchant marks and icons from 04 · Media. 6. Copy and data must match “Fixed data” exactly. This brief wins over anything you may know of the original kit.\" x=\"0\" y=\"51\" width=\"1312\" height=\"176\" />\n    </frame>\n    <frame id=\"5:10\" name=\"Frames · goals · must include · links\" x=\"64\" y=\"532\" width=\"1312\" height=\"805\">\n      <text id=\"5:11\" name=\"Frames · goals · must include · links\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"413\" height=\"35\" />\n      <text id=\"5:12\" name=\"Frame names are fixed. Must-include lists are grouped by subject and sorted A–Z: they state what is on the screen, never where it goes or how it looks.\" x=\"0\" y=\"51\" width=\"1312\" height=\"22\" />\n      <frame id=\"5:13\" name=\"Frame cards\" x=\"0\" y=\"89\" width=\"1312\" height=\"716\">\n        <frame id=\"5:14\" name=\"01_Onboarding\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"644\" height=\"276\">\n          <text id=\"5:15\" name=\"01_Onboarding\" x=\"24\" y=\"24\" width=\"134\" height=\"26\" />\n          <text id=\"5:16\" name=\"Goal: Understand the app and choose to start.\" x=\"24\" y=\"60\" width=\"596\" height=\"20\" />\n          <text id=\"5:17\" name=\"MUST INCLUDE\" x=\"24\" y=\"90\" width=\"84\" height=\"16\" />\n          <text id=\"5:18\" name=\"• Actions: “Get Started” · “Sign in” • Copy: “Pay / Manage / Grow…” (one word per line) · “An easy app to manage all your payment and finance-related needs” · “Already have an account?” • Media: Illustration_Onboarding\" x=\"24\" 