hen Call C2 (frames): rebuild 01 + 03 fully, no x/y overrides on nested instance children except where allowed (text characters, fills, visible). For tile2/3: swap icon (24×24 lands at (45,12) ✓), recolor white, set label characters ✓ centered automatically. Account tiles: swap mark (26×26 at (3,3) ✓), set texts. Transaction rows: swap mark; amazon → resize(24,24) position (6,6) ✓ already; avatar → try y=0; catch → overlay.\n\nThen Call D: 02 + 04. Call E: reactions. Call F: screenshots.\n\nWait — one more consideration on `recolor` inside instances: fills overrides allowed ✓ standard.\n\nAlso for the tile icon swap: does swapComponent reset size to component native (24×24)? If it resets, position (45,12) preserved? Position is stored... after swap, new node keeps old node's transform typically. Native 24 = my new design size anyway → even if reset, lands (45,12) 24×24 ✓. \n\nAlso: tile2 label \"Receive\" — changing characters of a fixed-width centered text: recenters automatically ✓.\n\nLet me also double check Action Tile icon position math: 24 icon in 114 → x=45. y=12 (icon 24 → bottom 36; label at y=36+? label y=36 h=15 → bottom 51, tile 64 → bottom pad 13. Icon y=10? total: icon 10..34, label 38..53, pad bottom 11. Adjust: icon y=10, label y=37. Fine: icon (45,10) 24×24; label y=37.\n\nAccount tile: chip (12,15) 32×32; mark 26×26 at (3,3) → centered ✓.\n\nMenu item icon: (3,14) 24×24 → bottom 38; label 15px at y=16 h=18 → center 25; icon center 26 ✓ close.\n\nTransaction chip: (12,10) 36×36 r18; mark (6,6) 24×24 ✓.\n\nNow write Call C1 (component repairs + probes). Include:\n- probe: set x on nested TEXT inside instance (temp instance of Action Tile): results → adapt.\n- probe: visible=false on nested mark inside Account Tile instance.\n- probe: after swapComponent on a nested mark instance, read x/y/w/h.\n\nThen Call C2 with full knowledge. Actually to save round trips: C1 does repairs + probes + RETURNS data; C2 builds frames using learned rules.\n\nC1 code:\n```js\nawait load fonts (needed? for text ops only — no text chars changed here except maybe none; skip? resizing text nodes doesn't need font load? Safer load Regular/Semi Bold.)\n// 1. Action Tile icon+label\nconst tAct=get(\"8:14\"); const ic=tAct.findOne(n=>n.type===\"INSTANCE\"); ic.resize(24,24); ic.x=45; ic.y=10;\nconst lb=tAct.findOne(n=>n.type===\"TEXT\"); lb.resize(114,lb.height); lb.x=0; lb.y=37; lb.textAlignHorizontal=\"CENTER\";\n// 2. Account Tile mark\nconst chipA=get(\"8:19\"); const m=chipA.children[0]; m.resize(26,26); m.x=3; m.y=3;\n// 3. Menu Item icon\nconst mi=get(\"8:35\"); const mic=mi.findOne(n=>n.type===\"INSTANCE\"); mic.resize(24,24); mic.x=3; mic.y=14;\n// 4. Balance Card duplicate\nget(\"8:66\").remove();\n// probes\nconst inst=tAct.createInstance(); ws.appendChild(inst); inst.x=50; inst.y=1100;\nconst pr={};\nconst lic=inst.findOne(n=>n.type===\"INSTANCE\");\ntry{ lic.x=10; pr.iconX=\"ok \"+lic.x; }catch(e){ pr.iconX=\"ERR\"; }\ntry{ lic.visible=false; pr.iconVisible=\"ok\"; lic.visible=true; }catch(e){ pr.iconVisible=\"ERR\"; }\npr.iconAfterSwap=(()=>{ try{ lic.swapComponent(get(\"4:18\")); return JSON.stringify({x:lic.x,y:lic.y,w:lic.width,h:lic.height}); }catch(e){ return \"ERR:\"+e.message; } })();\nconst lbt=inst.findOne(n=>n.type===\"TEXT\");\ntry{ lbt.x=0; pr.textX=\"ok\"; }catch(e){ pr.textX=\"ERR\"; }\ntry{ lbt.characters=\"Receive\"; pr.textChars=\"ok\"; }catch(e){ pr.textChars=\"ERR\"; }\ninst.remove();\n```\nAlso probe swap on account tile mark nested (chip > instance): \n```js\nconst inst2=get(\"8:18\").createInstance(); ws.appendChild(inst2); inst2.x=250; inst2.y=1100;\nconst mk=inst2.findOne(n=>n.type===\"INSTANCE\"&&n.name.startsWith(\"Bank\"));\ntry{ mk.swapComponent(get(\"4:7\")); pr.markSwap=JSON.stringify({x:mk.x,y:mk.y,w:mk.width,h:mk.height}); }catch(e){ pr.markSwap=\"ERR\"; }\n// text override inside instance\nconst t1=inst2.findOne(n=>n.type===\"TEXT\"&&n.characters===\"Axis Bank\");\ntry{ t1.characters=\"HDFC Bank\"; pr.tileText=\"ok\"; }catch(e){ pr.tileText=\"ERR: \"+e.message.slice(0,80); }\ninst2.remove();\n```\n\nNote: probes modify temp instances then remove them → clean.\n\nAlso fix: my components were appended to ws ✓.\n\nThen C2. Let me write C1 now.","signature":"3171ffe44ea54d4aaf2daeda"}],"id":"b360642e-5cbb-49f4-b370-cce45497a238","model":"glm-5.3-flash","role":"assistant","stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"type":"message","usage":{"input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"cc0b1614-1a50-4b76-91ee-9a5812ecc44e","uuid":"bf07ada5-c812-4395-b534-adea8f48379b","timestamp":"2026-10-31T23:14:28.623Z","thinking_duration_ms":56575}
