{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"This session is being continued from a previous conversation that ran out of context. The summary below covers the earlier portion of the conversation.\n\n<tools-used-before-summary>mcp__figma__get_metadata, mcp__figma__use_figma, mcp__figma__whoami</tools-used-before-summary>\nSummary:\n1. Primary Request and Intent:\n   Complete a full product design in the assigned Figma file https://www.figma.com/design/CzkDgUe1dyJA7vCKriV99m/ (fileKey `CzkDgUe1dyJA7vCKriV99m`) for an unattended design benchmark:\n   - Verify account is zhengyaozhi@tetras.ai via whoami (DONE — confirmed)\n   - Read \"00 · Start Here\" for the brief, \"01 · Foundations\" for visual rules, reuse \"02 · Components\", use \"04 · Media\" assets\n   - Deliver the complete design inside \"03 · Workspace\" (page 6:2) of THIS file; preserve all reference pages/nodes; do not create other files or switch accounts\n   - Build exactly 4 frames named exactly `01_Onboarding`, `02_Phone_Number`, `03_Home`, `04_Menu` (390×844, iPhone), plus reusable components, with verbatim data/copy, and wire the required prototype links\n   - Use only the supplied Figma tools (whoami, get_metadata, get_screenshot, use_figma); no delegating to other agents\n   - PROCESS REQUIREMENT (from system prompt): every assistant message with a tool call must begin with a line starting exactly `Reasoning summary:` before the call, and after each tool result before the next call. Final response must be `Reasoning summary: ...` on the first line, then `Final answer:` with: assigned file URL, 03·Workspace page ID, screen IDs, prototype work completed, remaining limitations. Never claim completion for unfinished work.\n   - Inspection via read-only use_figma; build via use_figma; verify with get_screenshot on all screens; fix visible problems and re-check.\n\n2. Key Technical Concepts:\n   - Figma Plugin API via `use_figma` (MCP): scripts are ATOMIC — any thrown error rolls back the ENTIRE script (verified: failed Call B left zero nodes)\n   - Fonts MUST be loaded in every call before text ops: Inter Regular/Medium/Semi Bold/Bold via `figma.loadFontAsync`\n   - **Instance override rules (learned via probes)**: on children nested INSIDE an instance — `x`/`y` (relative-transform) BLOCKED, `visible` BLOCKED; `resize` OK; text `characters` OK; root/child `fills` OK; `swapComponent` OK but must be done FIRST (probe swaps failed after prior failed ops on same node; in real build swap+resize succeeded before the x error)\n   - **Reactions (new API format)**: `node.reactions = [{ action:{type:\"NODE\", destinationId, navigation:\"NAVIGATE\"|\"OVER\", transition:{type:\"MOVE_IN\"|\"MOVE_OUT\"|\"PUSH\"|\"SLIDE_IN\"|\"SLIDE_OUT\", direction, duration, easing:{type:\"EASE_OUT\"}}}, trigger:{type:\"ON_CLICK\"} }]` — old format (type:\"CLICK\", DISSOLVE) fails validation; direction values untested (plan: \"BOTTOM\" for sheet, \"LEFT\" for drawer; error will enumerate valid values)\n   - `swapComponent(componentNode)` exists on InstanceNode; media/bank/merchant/icon nodes are COMPONENTS (createInstance works)\n   - Avatars/illustration/merchant marks are image-fill frames (no vector children); HSBC mark has vectors; icons are 24×24 native line icons (#1A1A1F)\n   - get_metadata for structure; get_screenshot for verification\n   - No comments in code; no setPluginData/loadAllPagesAsync/createImageAsync (forbidden)\n\n3. Files and Code Sections:\n   - **Figma page 0:1 (00 · Start Here)** — the brief. Frame names fixed; must-include lists:\n     - `01_Onboarding`: \"Get Started\" · \"Sign in\"; \"Pay / Manage / Grow…\" one word per line; \"An easy app to manage all your payment and finance-related needs\"; \"Already have an account?\"; Illustration_Onboarding. LINK: Get Started → 02_Phone_Number\n     - `02_Phone_Number`: \"Cancel\" · \"Get Started\"; \"Phone Number\" · +91 · empty placeholder 9812345678 · focused; header \"Get Started\" · \"Please enter the mobile phone number\"; Numeric Keypad open; sheet over 01_Onboarding. LINKS: Get Started → 03_Home; Cancel → 01_Onboarding\n     - `03_Home`: Axis Bank ₹3,500 · HDFC Bank ₹63,520 · Deutsche Bank ₹36,258 · Union Bank ₹67,820 each with mark; Send (Icon_Send) · Receive (Icon_Receive) · refresh (Icon_Refresh) · \"Transaction History\" · \"Scan any QR\" (Icon_Scan); Bank_HSBC · \"Last Updated Balance\" · ₹85,625 · \"Primary\" (Icon_Check_Badge); Avatar_Hallie_Goebel (opens menu) · search \"Pay by name or phone\" (Icon_Search) · history (Icon_History); \"Invite friends and get ₹1,000 reward\" (Icon_Offer); \"RECENT TRANSACTIONS\" + 3 rows: \"Paytm Auto Pay · 22 Jan · Weekly transaction · −₹3,500\" (Merchant_Paytm), \"Risa Midyett · 05 Jan · Gift for Christmas · +₹6,950\" (Avatar_Risa_Midyett), \"Amazon Pantry · 01 Jan · Subscription payment · −₹1,200\" (Merchant_Amazon). Note − is U+2212. LINK: avatar → 04_Menu\n     - `04_Menu`: Avatar_Hallie_Goebel · \"Hallie Goebel\" · hallie.goebel@example.com; \"Logout\" (Icon_Logout); menu source order: New Payment (Icon_New_Payment) · Bank Accounts (Icon_Bank) · All Transactions (Icon_History) · Rewards & Offers (Icon_Offer) · Settings (Icon_Settings); side menu over 03_Home partly visible. LINK: tap visible part of home → 03_Home\n     - Navigation: no tab bar; all other items entry-only (no links)\n   - **Page 1:2 (Foundations)**: brand #1E32FA \"ultramarine\" fixed; Inter fixed; canvas 390×844; everything else designer-defined\n   - **Page 1:3 (Components)**: given components — Button `1:23` (358×52, #1E32FA, r26, \"Get Started\" Inter Semi Bold 16 white), Text Field `1:26` (label 14 SemiBold #1A1A1F + input 358×52 white r12, placeholder \"9812345678\" 16 Regular #9A9AA3), Status Bar `1:33` (390×47, black glyphs), Home Indicator `1:44` (390×34), Numeric Keypad `1:46` (390×226, bg #D1D3D9, white keys, black text)\n   - **Page 1:4 (Media) component IDs**: Illustration_Onboarding `4:5` (178×260); Avatar_Hallie_Goebel `4:2` (72×72); Avatar_Risa_Midyett `4:3` (48×72, aspect 2:3); Bank_Axis `4:10`, Bank_Deutsche `4:6`, Bank_HDFC `4:7`, Bank_Union `4:9` (all 26×26); Bank_HSBC `4:11` (75×21); Merchant_Paytm `4:4` (72×72); Merchant_Amazon `4:24` (26×26); Icon_Bank `4:8`, Icon_Check_Badge `4:12`, Icon_Close `4:13`, Icon_History `4:14`, Icon_Logout `4:15`, Icon_New_Payment `4:16`, Icon_Offer `4:17`, Icon_Receive `4:18`, Icon_Refresh `4:19`, Icon_Scan `4:20`, Icon_Search `4:21`, Icon_Settings `4:22`, Icon_Send `4:23` (all 24×24)\n   - **Page 6:2 (03 · Workspace)** — delivery target. CURRENT CONTENT (all at y=1000): `8:14` Tile / Action (x=0, 114×64, r16; icon 24×24 at (45,10); label 114-wide CENTER x=0 y=37); `8:18` Tile / Account (x=150, 175×62, r14 white + shadowCard; chip 32×32 r8 #F0F2F7 at (12,15) containing Bank_Axis instance 26×26 at (3,3); texts \"Axis Bank\" 13 SemiBold (54,11), \"₹3,500\" 14 SemiBold (54,32)); `8:24` Row / Transaction (x=360, 358×56, r14 white; chip 36×36 r18 #F0F2F7 at (12,10) w/ Merchant_Paytm 24×24 at (6,6); \"Paytm Auto Pay\" 14 SemiBold (60,9); \"22 Jan · Weekly transaction\" 12 GRAY600 (60,29); \"−₹3,500\" 14 SemiBold RED (254,19) w90 RIGHT); `8:30` Banner / Reward (x=750, 358×56 r16 TINT; Icon_Offer 22 BRAND (16,17); text 14 SemiBold (50,19)); `8:35` Item / Menu (x=1140, 264×52, no fill r12; icon 24×24 at (3,14); \"New Payment\" 15 Medium (38,16)); `8:40` Field / Phone · Focused (x=1440, 358×77; label \"Phone Number\" 14 SemiBold (0,0); Input 358×52 white r12 stroke BRAND w2 INSIDE at (0,25); \"+91\" 16 SemiBold (16,17); divider 1×24 BORDER (58,14); caret 2×22 BRAND (70,15); \"9812345678\" 16 GRAY400 (80,17)); `8:47` Card / Balance (x=1830, 358×150 r20 BRAND + shadowBrand, clips; deco ellipse 200 white 7% at (230,-70); Bank_HSBC 42×12 at (20,24); Primary pill 82×24 white 18% r12 at (256,20) w/ Icon_Check_Badge 14 white (10,5) + \"Primary\" 12 Medium white (28,5); \"Last Updated Balance\" 12 Medium white 75% (20,66); \"₹85,625\" 32 Bold white (20,86); Refresh circle 40×40 white 16% at (298,88) w/ Icon_Refresh 20 white (10,10))\n   - **Paint styles created (10)**: Brand/Primary, Text/Primary, Text/Secondary, Text/Placeholder, Surface/Page, Surface/Card, Border/Default, State/Positive, State/Negative, Surface/Tint\n   - **Color system**: BRAND #1E32FA, INK #1A1A1F, GRAY600 #6B6B76, GRAY400 #9A9AA3, BG #F5F6FA, SURFACE #FFFFFF, BORDER #E7E8EE, GREEN #0BA678, RED #E5484D, TINT #EEF1FF, CHIP #F0F2F7\n   - **Reusable helper pattern** (used in every build call):\n     ```js\n     const sp = h => ({type:\"SOLID\", color:(()=>{const n=parseInt(h.slice(1),16);return {r:((n>>16)&255)/255,g:((n>>8)&255)/255,b:(n&255)/255};})()});\n     function mkText(parent,str,o){ const t=figma.createText(); t.fontName={family:\"Inter\",style:o.style||\"Regular\"}; t.characters=str; t.fontSize=o.size||14; t.fills=[sp(o.color||C.INK)]; if(o.lh) t.lineHeight={unit:\"PIXELS\",value:o.lh}; if(o.ls!==undefined) t.letterSpacing={unit:\"PERCENT\",value:o.ls}; if(o.w){ t.resize(o.w,t.height); } parent.appendChild(t); t.x=o.x||0; t.y=o.y||0; return t; }\n     function recolor(n,paint){ for(const x of [n,...n.findAll(()=>true)]){ if(\"fills\" in x && Array.isArray(x.fills)&&x.fills.length>0&&x.fills.every(f=>f.type===\"SOLID\")) x.fills=[paint]; if(\"strokes\" in x && Array.isArray(x.strokes)&&x.strokes.length>0&&x.strokes.every(s=>s.type===\"SOLID\")) x.strokes=[paint]; } }\n     const shadowCard = {type:\"DROP_SHADOW\", color:{r:0.05,g:0.06,b:0.15,a:0.05}, offset:{x:0,y:2}, radius:6, spread:0, visible:true, blendMode:\"NORMAL\"};\n     const shadowBrand = {type:\"DROP_SHADOW\", color:{r:0.12,g:0.2,b:0.98,a:0.25}, offset:{x:0,y:10}, radius:24, spread:0, visible:true, blendMode:\"NORMAL\"};\n     ```\n\n4. Errors and fixes:\n   - **Syntax error in first Call B** (accidental placeholder `y=0? 0:0` + \"ABORT\"): nothing executed; rewrote script fully.\n   - **\"in set_x: This property cannot be overridden in an instance: relative-transform\"** (Call B attempt 2, at `ic.x=46` on a nested icon instance inside a tile instance): entire script rolled back (no partial state persisted). FIX STRATEGY: never set x/y/visible on children nested inside instances; instead redesigned components so swaps need no repositioning — Action Tile icon now native 24×24 at (45,10); label resized to w=114, x=0, textAlignHorizontal CENTER, y=37 (changing characters auto-recenters); Account Tile mark native 26×26 at (3,3); Menu Item icon 24×24 at (3,14). Call order rule: do `swapComponent` FIRST on any nested node, then `resize` (allowed), then fills/text (allowed).\n   - **Duplicate \"Last Updated Balance\" text (8:66)** in Card / Balance component from Call A bug: removed in Call C1.\n   - **Reactions validation error** (old format `{type:\"CLICK\"}`, `transition:{type:\"DISSOLVE\"}`): discovered correct schema from the error message — trigger `ON_CLICK`; transition must be MOVE_IN/MOVE_OUT/PUSH/SLIDE_IN/SLIDE_OUT with required `direction` + `easing`; will use `easing:{type:\"EASE_OUT\"}`; navigation \"NAVIGATE\"/\"OVER\" (untested — errors will enumerate valid values).\n   - **Probe swap failures (iconSwap \"node 12:7 does not exist\", rowSwap ERR)** after prior failed ops (x/visible) on the same node — conclusion: do swaps before other ops; swap on fresh nested instances worked (markSwap probe OK with position preserved `{x:3,y:3,w:26,h:26}`; in real Call B tile swap+resize worked before the x error).\n\n5. Problem Solving:\n   - Established atomic-rollback behavior (rebuild must start from clean frame state; current state verified: only 7 components exist, no frames, no strays)\n   - Designed override-light component architecture to work within instance restrictions (fixed positions for all swappable icons/marks; full-width centered labels)\n   - Resolved prototype reaction API format from validation error\n   - Planned avatar-in-transaction-row handling: swap to Avatar_Risa then resize(24,36) staying at (6,6) — bottom 6px clipped by chip