ible\":\"ERR\",\"iconSwap\":\"ERR:in swapComponent: The node with id \\\"12:7\\\" does not exist\",\"textX\":\"ERR\",\"textChars\":\"ok w=114\",\"markSwap\":\"{\\\"x\\\":3,\\\"y\\\":3,\\\"w\\\":26,\\\"h\\\":26}\",\"tileText\":\"ok\",\"rowResize\":\"ok\",\"rowY\":\"ERR\",\"rowVisible\":\"ERR\",\"rowSwap\":\"ERR\"}`. Components are repaired and ready; workspace contains only the 7 components (8:14, 8:18, 8:24, 8:30, 8:35, 8:40, 8:47) at y=1000 plus 10 paint styles; NO frames exist yet.\n   Detailed frame layouts planned (key coordinates):\n   - **01_Onboarding** (390×844 @ 0,0, bg BG): status bar 1:33 (0,0); TINT ellipse 280 at (55,66); illustration 4:5 resized 200×292 at (95,96); \"Pay\"/\"Manage\"/\"Grow…\" Bold 40 lh48 at (24,432/480/528), \"Grow…\" BRAND; subtitle 15 Regular GRAY600 w310 lh22 at (24,596); Button 1:23 instance (16,664); footer text \"Already have an account?  Sign in\" 14 Medium GRAY600 with range [indexOf(\"Sign in\")→end] Semi Bold + BRAND fills, centered x=(390-w)/2, y=740; home indicator (0,810)\n   - **03_Home** (390×844 @ 940,0, bg BG): status bar; avatar 4:2 44×44 (16,56); search frame 252×44 r22 white stroke BORDER (70,56) w/ Icon_Search 18 GRAY400 (16,13) + \"Pay by name or phone\" 14 GRAY400 (42,13); history circle 44×44 r22 white stroke (330,56) w/ Icon_History 20 INK (12,12); balance card 8:47 instance (16,116); action tiles 8:14 at (16,282)/(138,282)/(260,282) — tile2: swap icon→4:18 FIRST, resize(22,22) [wait: components now use 24×24 at (45,10) — after swap DO NOT resize/position, icon lands correctly; set tile2.fills=[GREEN], label characters \"Receive\"; tile3: swap→4:20, fills INK, label \"Scan any QR\"]; banner 8:30 (16,362); \"OTHER ACCOUNTS\" 11 SemiBold GRAY600 ls7 (16,438); account tiles 8:18 at (16,460)/(199,460)/(16,530)/(199,530) — HDFC (swap 4:7), Deutsche (4:6), Union (4:9), text overrides \"HDFC Bank\"/\"₹63,520\" etc.; \"RECENT TRANSACTIONS\" (16,608); \"Transaction History\" 13 SemiBold BRAND x=374-w y=606; rows 8:24 at (16,638) Paytm default, (16,696) Risa (swap 4:3, resize 24×36), (16,754) Amazon (swap 4:24, resize 24×24); home indicator (0,810)\n\n9. Optional Next Step:\n   Submit Call C2 via use_figma: build the `01_Onboarding` and `03_Home` frames exactly per the layout above using the safe-override rules (load all 4 Inter fonts first; `swapComponent` before any other op on nested nodes; `resize`/`characters`/`fills` allowed; NEVER set x/y/visible on nested instance children; wrap risky swaps in try/catch with overlay fallbacks), returning the new frame IDs and key child IDs (btn1 on 01, avatar on 03) for the subsequent reaction call. This directly continues the rolled-back Call B work — per my last message: “现在完整提交 01_Onboarding 与 03_Home 的构建脚本” and the repair message “让组件内图标统一为原生 24×24、标签改为整行居中，使实例只需换组件和改文字、无需位置覆盖” — after which: build 02/04, wire reactions, screenshot-verify all screens, then produce the final \"Reasoning summary / Final answer\" response.\n\nIf you need specific details from before compaction (like exact code snippets, error messages, or content you generated), read the full transcript at: /mnt/afs/huangxinyue/bench-runs/10case-6models-v4-20261101/runs/TEST-036_1793487676596/claude-config/projects/-mnt-afs-huangxinyue-bench-runs-10case-6models-v4-20261101-workspace/cc0b1614-1a50-4b76-91ee-9a5812ecc44e.jsonl\nContinue the conversation from where it left off without asking the user any further questions. Resume directly — do not acknowledge the summary, do not recap what was happening, do not preface with \"I'll continue\" or similar. Pick up the last task as if the break never happened.\n\nThe messages after this summary are the most recent messages from before compaction, kept verbatim. The summary was written without seeing them, so something it says has not happened yet may already have happened in them."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"cc0b1614-1a50-4b76-91ee-9a5812ecc44e","uuid":"f267d436-6685-4efc-8aa2-2782e51ee824","timestamp":"2026-10-