ey variant probe (read-only; if it errors \"file not found\", harmless).\n\nActually hold on, one more: IDEA 12 — maybe use_figma on a DIFFERENT PAGE's node forces a different doc slice?? The session loads the whole document... frozen regardless.\n\nIDEA 13: Check whether the frozen session is per-file: use_figma with fileKey of ANOTHER file — I have no other file key. Skip.\n\nGo: screenshot 15:2 first (doubles as design verification), then freshness probe.","signature":"c14feb046d0d40709e4b12e0"}],"id":"05f57ba6-1ef6-4b7c-b3fa-30824246f6c9","model":"glm-5.3-flash","role":"assistant","stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"type":"message","usage":{"input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"cc0b1614-1a50-4b76-91ee-9a5812ecc44e","uuid":"28d3bafb-7fd7-47ea-a96c-ec422c7fb646","timestamp":"2026-10-31T23:31:45.528Z","thinking_duration_ms":38662}
