{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"This session is being continued from a previous conversation that ran out of context. The summary below covers the earlier portion of the conversation.\n\n<tools-used-before-summary>mcp__figma__get_metadata, mcp__figma__get_screenshot, mcp__figma__use_figma, mcp__figma__whoami</tools-used-before-summary>\nSummary:\n1. Primary Request and Intent:\n   Complete a full product design in the assigned Figma file https://www.figma.com/design/CzkDgUe1dyJA7vCKriV99m/ (fileKey `CzkDgUe1dyJA7vCKriV99m`) for an unattended design benchmark:\n   - Account verified as zhengyaozhi@tetras.ai via whoami (DONE in earlier session)\n   - Read \"00 · Start Here\" for the brief, \"01 · Foundations\" for visual rules, reuse \"02 · Components\" (page 1:3) and \"04 · Media\" (page 1:4) assets\n   - Deliver the complete design inside \"03 · Workspace\" (page 6:2) of THIS file; preserve all reference pages/nodes; do not create other files or switch accounts\n   - Build exactly 4 frames named exactly `01_Onboarding`, `02_Phone_Number`, `03_Home`, `04_Menu` (390×844), plus reusable components, with verbatim data/copy, and wire required prototype links\n   - Use only supplied tools (whoami, get_metadata, get_screenshot, use_figma); no delegating\n   - PROCESS REQUIREMENT (from system prompt): every assistant message with a tool call must begin with a line starting exactly `Reasoning summary:`; after each tool result before the next call, same. Final response must be `Reasoning summary: ...` on the first line, then `Final answer:` with: assigned file URL, 03·Workspace page ID, screen IDs, prototype work completed, remaining limitations. Never claim completion for unfinished work.\n   - Inspect screenshots of all required screens; fix visible problems; verify. Unattended: resolve routine choices from brief, don't wait.\n\n2. Key Technical Concepts:\n   - Figma Plugin API via `use_figma` MCP tool; fonts must be loaded each call: Inter Regular/Medium/Semi Bold/Bold via `figma.loadFontAsync`\n   - **CRITICAL ENVIRONMENT QUIRK — FROZEN SESSION VIEW**: the `use_figma` plugin session's document view froze at the \"7 components only\" state. Reads (`getNodeById`, `ws.children`, `findAll`) can NOT see any nodes created after that point. Writes DO flush to the real file. `get_metadata` and `get_screenshot` read the TRUE cloud state. Cross-call `getNodeById` of newly created nodes returns null.\n   - Failed/thrown scripts STILL FLUSH partial changes (stray 8:12 proves it) — the earlier \"atomic rollback\" assumption is WRONG\n   - Sandbox throws TypeError on unknown property ACCESS (e.g., `tmp.createRectangle`)\n   - `use_figma` rejects arbitrary sessionId: \"Invalid sessionId. Retry this tool call without sessionId, or call create_session and use its returned UUID as sessionId.\" — no create_session tool is exposed\n   - **REACTIONS API (validated via probes)**: `node.reactions = [{trigger:{type:\"ON_CLICK\"}, actions:[{type:\"NODE\", destinationId, navigation:\"NAVIGATE\", transition}]}]` — field is `actions` (plural); `transition` is REQUIRED for NODE actions (or explicitly null)\n   - Transition union (validated): `{type:\"SMART_ANIMATE\"|\"DISSOLVE\"|\"SCROLL_ANIMATE\", duration, easing:{type:\"EASE_OUT\"}}`; `{type:\"MOVE_IN\"|\"MOVE_OUT\"|\"PUSH\"|\"SLIDE_IN\"|\"SLIDE_OUT\", direction, matchLayers:true, duration, easing:{type:\"EASE_OUT\"}}`; `transition:null` also valid\n   - Semantic constraint: \"for NAVIGATE actions, destinations must be a different top-level frame on the same page\"; invalid source (loose rectangle) → \"destination was rejected... source may not be a valid prototype source\"\n   - Instance override rules: nested-in-instance x/y/visible BLOCKED; swapComponent/resize/characters/fills OK; do swap FIRST, then resize; components designed so swaps need no repositioning\n   - Forbidden API: setPluginData, loadAllPagesAsync, createImageAsync\n\n3. Files and Code Sections:\n   - **Figma file CzkDgUe1dyJA7vCKriV99m, page 6:2 (03 · Workspace)** — CURRENT CLOUD STATE (per get_metadata):\n     - `8:12` stray 10×10 \"Rectangle\" at (0,0) — probe leftover, MUST DELETE\n     - 7 components at y=1000: `8:14` Tile/Action, `8:18` Tile/Account, `8:24` Row/Transaction, `8:30` Banner/Reward, `8:35` Item/Menu, `8:40` Field/Phone·Focused, `8:47` Card/Balance\n     - **DUPLICATES TO DELETE**: `13:2` (01_Onboarding duplicate), `13:25` (03_Home duplicate)\n     - **GOOD FRAME SET (final deliverables)**:\n       - `15:2` 01_Onboarding @ (0,0): Status Bar 15:3, Ellipse 15:14, Illustration 15:15, texts 15:16/17/18 (Pay/Manage/Grow…), subtitle 15:19, Button 15:20, footer 15:22, Home Indicator 15:23\n       - `15:25` 03_Home @ (940,0): Status Bar 15:26, Avatar 15:37, Search 15:38 (icon 15:39, text 15:42), History button 15:43 (icon 15:44), Card/Balance 15:47, action tiles 15:83/15:88/15:93, Banner 15:98, \"OTHER ACCOUNTS\" 15:105, account tiles 15:134 (Axis @16,460), 15:106 (HDFC @199,460), 15:118 (Deutsche @16,530), 15:126 (Union @199,530), \"RECENT TRANSACTIONS\" 15:140, \"Transaction History\" 15:141, rows 15:142 (Paytm @16,638), 15:148 (Risa @16,696), 15:154 (Amazon @16,754), Home Indicator 15:162\n       - `15:164` 02_Phone_Number @ (470,0): 01-clone children 15:165–15:174, scrim 15:175, Sheet 15:176 @ (0,204) 390×640 containing grabber 15:177, Cancel 15:178, \"Get Started\" 15:179, subtitle 15:180, Field 15:181, Button 15:188, Numeric Keypad 15:190\n       - `15:221` 04_Menu @ (1410,0): 03-clone children 15:222–15:244, scrim 15:245, Side Menu 15:246 312×844 containing avatar 15:247, name 15:248, email 15:249, divider 15:250, menu items 15:251/15:258/15:264/15:271/15:278 (@y 240/300/360/420/480), Logout 15:285 @ (24,760), Home Indicator 15:291\n     - NO reactions exist anywhere yet\n   - **Reusable helper pattern** (used in every build call):\n     ```js\n     const sp = h => ({type:\"SOLID\", color:(()=>{const n=parseInt(h.slice(1),16);return {r:((n>>16